        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Nike, Inc., Wieden+Kennedy\n- People: Dan Wieden\n- Products: Swoosh, \"Just Do It\"\n- Topics: branding, advertising\n\nFacts:\n- Dan Wieden, born in 1945 and pronounced \"Why-den,\" is an American advertising executive.\n- Dan Wieden co-founded Wieden+Kennedy and coined Nike's tagline \"Just Do It.\"\n- The Swoosh is the logo of Nike, Inc., an American athletic shoe and clothing manufacturer.\n- In many Nike-related situations, \"Just Do It\" appears alongside the Swoosh.\n- The Swoosh has become one of the most recognizable brand logos in the world.\n- The Swoosh alone has been valued at $26 billion.",
